From 0f9f5ee82cc8804c2c09db1050950feed8a11be7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 21:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add keyboard shortcuts from issue #6

- Add 'q' quit universally across all pages (endpoint list, request
  builder, response viewer) - previously only on server list
- Add Home/End key support on server list and endpoint list
- Add PageUp/PageDown on server list, endpoint list, and response viewer;
  page size is tracked from the rendered area height via Cell<u16>
- Add endpoint list sorting with 's' key (cycles: none -> method -> path)
  with the active sort mode shown in the title bar
- Add curl command popup on endpoint list with 'c' key showing a template
  curl command for the selected endpoint
- Add save-to-file dialog on response viewer with 's' key; Enter saves
  the response body to the typed filename
- Update all help bars to reflect the new keybindings
- Fix pre-existing clippy::manual_div_ceil warning in ui/mod.rs

Closes #6
